Z||000000||TRiAD||12-29-2001||11:43 AM||||Man. I hate it when people put a job ad in the classifieds and either put NO description, or very little, and finish off with "Apply In Person at...". No phone number, no email, no website, no explanation of the position or compansation. <P>You see, when you've beenlaid off for a long time (I've been off since July), the fact that it takes GAS to go "apply in person", and therefore costs MONEY is a big deal. <P>You spend up to $5, and blow an entire afternoon, just to get there and find out it's an "experience only" position lifting 150lbs all day long for $6 and hour! <P>Sorry. Going through the classifieds (again) and needed to vent. <BR><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://centralillinoisimports.org/uploads/files/SigRear4.gif">  <BR><B><I><FONT COLOR="blue">Project MR1 ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</B><BR>AIM ~ Michael Blue 72</I></FONT>||||reg||9
