Z||000005||avengador1||12-29-2001||05:21 PM||||Hey Triad, I know finding a good job is hard, but let me ask you. Have you tried a head hunter?(job placement agency)I know they suck but sometimes they can hook you up with a sweet job. They might even be able to find you a temporary position which could turn into a permanent one, depending on the company that hires you. At least you will be working while you try to find that "good" job you are looking for. Just a suggestion...<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
