Z||000008||AusFiero||12-31-2001||12:28 AM||||Wow the wages in America sound low. Ok our dollar is worth half a US one but even labourers get over $10 an hour which fairs well in the local economy. I charge $50 an hour for web related work. Tradesman get between $50 to $100 if self employed. <BR>Most skilled workers if employed for someone else get about $25 an hour.<P>------------------<BR>          <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero5.gif">         <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
